{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DICEPUNK is a turn-based roguelike deck builder set in a cyberpunk world where every action is powered by dice rolls.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/f7255f32e00aa4bb24888ed48fc0577a.poster.avif?t=1761861338\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/f7255f32e00aa4bb24888ed48fc0577a.webm?t=1761861338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/f7255f32e00aa4bb24888ed48fc0577a.mp4?t=1761861338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck of dice, strategize your actions, and roll your way through tactical turn-based battles.Before each encounter, select and combine different dice types.During combat, roll your dice and allocate the results to your skills to trigger attacks, defenses, or special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/ccaae9afb595d652766f40885afe6034.poster.avif?t=1761861338\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/ccaae9afb595d652766f40885afe6034.webm?t=1761861338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/ccaae9afb595d652766f40885afe6034.mp4?t=1761861338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice Deck Building: Prepare your dice setup before entering battle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based Combat: Roll, allocate, and plan your next move carefully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/4d8691a3600703209fed639fd7979c70.poster.avif?t=1761861338\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/4d8691a3600703209fed639fd7979c70.webm?t=1761861338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/4d8691a3600703209fed639fd7979c70.mp4?t=1761861338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill System: Assign dice results to trigger attacks, defenses, or unique skill effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Progression: Unlock new dice and skills after each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/ce153891eb4647d363e757c1d41f41a6.poster.avif?t=1761861338\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/ce153891eb4647d363e757c1d41f41a6.webm?t=1761861338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098040/extras/ce153891eb4647d363e757c1d41f41a6.mp4?t=1761861338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DICEPUNK blends tactical deck building, dice-driven combat, and roguelike progression into a challenging system whe